  "description": "The OASIS API Native Integrated EndPoint. To be used to integrate the OASIS API directly into target applications (including Unity) instead of using the existing REST API. Can be used for offline/poor connection use cases, etc. This version will also of course be faster than the REST API. This version also contains some functionality not currently implemented in the REST API.",
